      "Third, it enables automation. A CRM can automatically send follow-up messages, review requests, and reactivation campaigns. It can remind you to call leads back. It can track which marketing channels are producing the most jobs.",
      "Do you need a CRM? If you have more than 10 leads a month, yes. If you're tracking leads in your head or on paper, you're losing track of some of them. A CRM ensures every lead is captured, followed up with, and tracked to completion.",
      "The system we build at Yugen includes a full CRM. Every lead from your website, your AI chat, your missed call text-back, and your forms flows into one inbox. You can manage everything from your phone. It's designed for contractors, not tech people — simple, intuitive, and focused on booking jobs."
